---
description: Identify exact named milestone endpoints from the user's goal and the observed archive.
args:
  goal: string
  scope: Scope
returns: Selection
---
Select the milestone or ordered milestones the user actually asks about and the exact field they want verified. Memory snippets are discovery leads. Use the catalog as the source of exact milestone names and event identifiers, including when an endpoint has no recall lead. Keep distinct revisions separate, including corrections and rollbacks. Do not substitute an adjacent or more recent milestone.
